{"version":1,"content":"<p>印度東部西孟加拉邦首府加爾各答一處印度教節日慶祝活動場地，上周六晚（17日）發生人踩人，至少17人死亡（死者包括一名7歲女童）、25人受傷。</p><p>據悉事發時當地突降大雨，人群推擠，有人跌倒，引發人踩人。</p><p>（法新社/新華社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T01:38:39.712195+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T01:02:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:37:34.852781+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:37:34.934107+00:00","content_hash":"df02b4dff297864b1834a9a19384de167f0c20c58ce304fd3bb136d782ac5eb3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}